OL,3,GNEWSARed tape killed Friday the 13th   
OL,4,Anight, bar says                        
OL,6,FThe owner of a cocktail bar says he was
OL,7,Fforced to cancel a movie night because 
OL,8,Fof red tape.                           
OL,10,FGeorge Drury, who runs George's        
OL,11,FCocktails, in Boston, Lincolnshire,    
OL,12,Fsold tickets for a screening of Friday 
OL,13,Fthe 13th, only to be told by the       
OL,14,Fborough council that the event would   
OL,15,Fbreak the law because he did not have a
OL,16,Flicence to show films.                 
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
