OL,3,GNEWSARed tape killed Friday the 13th   
OL,4,Anight, bar says                        
OL,6,FCouncillor Chris Mountain, portfolio   
OL,7,Fholder for infrastructure at the       
OL,8,Fcouncil, said he wanted "to see local  
OL,9,Fbusinesses succeed and grow", but      
OL,10,Fvenues needed the "necessary           
OL,11,Fauthorisation" to screen movies.       
OL,13,FDrury said: "I know rules are rules and
OL,14,FI'm not one for saying bend the rules  
OL,15,Ffor me, I'm just saying we need help   
OL,16,Ffrom the council instead of 'you can't 
OL,17,Fdo that'."                             
